# claude.ai export test fixtures (data/): exclude anything carrying real
# personal data even though the account itself is a throwaway test account.
# - light_metadata contains a real login IP address (geolocatable), not fake.
# - manifest-*.json files carry one-time-use export download URL tokens.
# - attachments/ is excluded defensively in case a future export ever
#   includes real binary attachment content (none does today).
